WEBVTT

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:31.550
The dragon's heading towards you, Kuroi-kun!

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.510
Meow!

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.260
Woof!

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.250
The dragon's heading this way!

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.320
Everyone, amplify your power!

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:05.140
<i>I'm scared... But I have to hang in there!</i>

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:08.210
I have to protect Soya-kun!

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:12.000
The dragon's heading towards you!

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.590
Telepath unit, withdraw!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:18.180
Don't ignore us!

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:24.980
It started moving!

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.060
Follow it!

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:47.880
Fools.

00:01:47.880 --> 00:01:51.000
Do you think you can defeat me?

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:03.470
Don't underestimate us!

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.440
Give it up!

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:14.550
You're still going to fight?

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:19.110
You're that Kigurumian...

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:23.630
And the survivor of Sirius!

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:25.490
The name's Soya Kuroi!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:26.960
Remember it!

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:30.750
Soya... Kuroi!

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:36.010
<b><i>Final Episode</i></b>

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:37.460
<b>Citizens' Safety Center Special Defense Unit
Nebula Temporary Branch Office</b>

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:39.930
This is the plan.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:48.350
<b>Moon</b>

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:45.190
We'll use the telepaths as bait to lure the 
dragon to a certain set of coordinates.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:46.520
<b>Episode 12: Behold, The Universe is Filled With Blessings</b>

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:48.350
Coordinates? Is there something there?

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.480
A hole.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.030
A hole?

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:55.970
In space?

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:57.770
I see. An exit?

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:58.610
What do you mean?

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:03.150
The dragon was thrown into subspace 
during his space-time banishment.

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:05.180
How do you think he got to the moon?

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:06.590
Um...

00:03:06.590 --> 00:03:10.340
We don't know if the dragon made the hole, 
or if it was there before he got there.

00:03:10.340 --> 00:03:14.040
But there's a subspace exit near the moon.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:18.260
We're going to drop him in 
that dimensional hole again.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:27.560
He's fast...

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:30.230
How can he accelerate so much at that size?!

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:35.260
Are you sure he hasn't noticed 
we're luring him into a trap?

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:38.440
The telepaths are supposed 
to be sending out waves

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:39.820
that will rob him of those thoughts...

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:43.150
The awareness jamming is working!

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:45.370
Focus! We're almost there!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.080
Soya-kun!

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:52.290
Kuroi-kun, you're holding on too tight.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:55.530
Rashaverak! Let's jump off for a moment!

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:56.460
Kuroi-kun!

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:58.270
No!

00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.380
We're almost there!

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:03.960
That's enough!

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:04.590
Split up!

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:05.550
Split up!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:06.640
Split up!

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:10.350
Begin Phase 2 of the operation!

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:31.290
The Kigurumian Spaceship Battalion is here!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.340
What?

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.340
Everyone, grab onto the dragon!

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:51.680
We've caught up!

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:56.810
Well done!

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.610
<i>Push</i> it!

00:04:58.930 --> 00:04:59.860
Here we go...

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.440
Ready...

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:07.080
Push!

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:17.670
How did I fail to notice 
the dimensional hole?

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:20.880
Telepathic awareness jamming!

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:24.290
Push!

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:31.520
Azrabarakura...

00:05:32.670 --> 00:05:36.230
Once again, I'm... nobody.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.920
Nobody...

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.230
Nobody!

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.440
Sirius...

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:48.790
No, Soya... Kuroi!

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:56.310
Soya-kun?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.050
Oh, you're finally awake, huh?

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.240
You're the People of Paradise!

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:13.510
What's going on?

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:16.230
What's gotten into you? Still half-asleep?

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.090
Huh?

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.940
Well, it's nice weather.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:23.650
I can see why you'd want to sleep outside.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.170
I'll sit down, too.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:28.720
Brother?

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.530
What's wrong?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.240
Oh, nothing.

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:36.500
I was having a weird dream.

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:42.210
Have you decided what
 you're doing after you graduate?

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:44.670
Not yet...

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:45.840
I see.

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:49.440
I'm going to join the army, like Dad.

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:52.590
Why? You're really wimpy.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.390
I'm a strong psychic.

00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:58.800
You don't need to do what Dad and I do.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.600
You can be a florist, like Grandpa.

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:04.500
You can't eat flowers.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:10.780
Well, if I join the army, 
Dad will leave you alone.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:12.780
You'll be free.

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:15.740
Free...

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.600
Oh, right. Tairan just came by the house.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.370
He wanted his book back.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:24.080
Tairan said you got in a fight with Katorne?

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:26.420
You should get along with her.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.580
She'll be beautiful when she grows up.

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:31.550
Katorne... Tairan?

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:35.160
Oh, and Belkel, the kid who moved.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:37.260
He's back.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:38.920
Belkel?

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:42.810
Go see them all before you head home.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.270
And make up with Katorne, too.

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:47.640
Yeah...

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.330
Now, let's go.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.350
Want to stop by that bakery on the way back?

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:55.530
Yeah...

00:07:56.290 --> 00:08:00.260
Mom's home today, so dinner 
will be really good.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:01.900
I can't wait.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:04.640
Yeah... Yeah...

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:09.580
What's wrong? Are you crying?

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.050
It's nothing..

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:15.030
It's nothing, Brother...

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.510
I'm just a little...

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:23.000
Brother?

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.270
Brother?

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:40.410
You get out of here!

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.680
Get away from the city!

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:42.830
Got it?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:46.250
Brother, don't go!

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.040
Brother!

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:02.170
Dragon...

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:06.060
Hate me, Soya Kuroi!

00:09:06.680 --> 00:09:08.330
I destroyed your home!

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:10.200
Killed those you love!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.320
Took your happiness!

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:15.270
I destroyed it all. Hate me!

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:18.510
Lonely creature who hates evil...

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:21.950
You are worthy to be the heir to my justice!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:27.670
Now destroy me, the one who became evil,
and carry out justice!

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:32.570
I'm your heir?

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.350
Sorry...

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:45.810
But Nebula already gave me a job.

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:47.300
Why?

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.100
You're...

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.530
I can't be who you want me to be!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:14.170
Ginko!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:15.300
Soya-kun!

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.470
Let's go!

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:24.990
Tera Cat Clog Hammer!

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:36.400
We've pushed the dragon into subspace!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:39.510
Everyone, evacuate!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:42.640
The hole is starting to repair itself.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:43.870
Hurry!

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.950
Takatori! Hitsujitani!

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:46.700
Right!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:47.750
On it!

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:51.880
I used too much power and 
can't maintain my speed.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.570
If I can at least get Miu-chan out of here...

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.910
Inaba, Kumashiro, are you okay?

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:03.230
Takatori-san!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.140
So this is the end, huh?

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:11.160
Torai-san?

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:14.400
You left enough power, 
like the plan said, right?

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.690
We need to get the civilians out, at least!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:20.390
I betrayed humanity once.

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.280
I'll sacrifice my life if I have to!

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:26.790
For Torai-san, who believed in us again...

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.120
I swear!

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.080
Get out of here before the hole closes!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.080
You'll be locked in!

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.210
<i>Hurry...</i>

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:42.990
There he is!

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.430
Soya-kun!

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:47.390
Earthlings, hurry!

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.220
You're falling behind!

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.360
The dragon's following us!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.240
Almost there...

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:02.820
He's fast!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:05.530
He'll escape too if we can't stop him!

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.010
Kuroi-kun?

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:58.040
The hole is repaired.

00:13:00.470 --> 00:13:03.580
The space-time banishment was successful.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.710
Soya-kun...

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:11.560
I couldn't save him.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:12.890
Kuroi...

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:14.980
No...

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:17.190
Kuroi-kun...

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:18.650
Damn it!

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:20.610
No...

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:26.050
The operation is complete. 
There were three casualties.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:35.000
Rashaverak!

00:13:57.650 --> 00:14:00.270
Sorry, Ginko, Sensei.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:03.080
We're locked into subspace.

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:07.570
"Don't worry about it," Sensei says.

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:10.410
Of course, I don't mind, either.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.910
Okay, let's go.

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:18.000
We still have a job to do.

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:27.820
Neither of us will last more than a few 
minutes inside this space-time storm.

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.930
It doesn't matter what you do.

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:35.850
Once, before the space-time 
storms ripped me apart,

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.380
I was able to find a dimensional hole.

00:14:39.020 --> 00:14:40.910
But that was a miracle that 
will never happen again.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:43.730
Azrabarakura! Open your mouth!

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:47.190
Don't call me that name!

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:52.790
What's an Azra-funyah-funyah?

00:14:54.170 --> 00:14:57.120
Probably his real name.

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:02.680
What are you doing?

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.840
Get out!

00:15:08.030 --> 00:15:09.800
The ship won't last!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:11.640
We're almost there!

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:13.100
Ginko!

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:14.300
Sensei!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.010
Soya-kun!

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:18.810
What are you going to do?

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:20.490
You come, too!

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.530
We're inside the dragon.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.660
Is this... a town?

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:50.090
Are you the dragon?

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.480
What do you want?

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:56.760
This place won't last long.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:16:00.730
We came to tell you something.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.480
Tell me something?

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:04.940
Thank you for showing me that dream.

00:16:05.820 --> 00:16:09.650
It made me remember that my 
homeland is still right here.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:17.480
I won't forget the happiness I had.

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.470
But I will forget the hate.

00:16:21.390 --> 00:16:23.960
I forgive you.

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:26.590
Ginko...

00:16:27.190 --> 00:16:27.860
Yeah.

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:35.470
Hello. I'm from Riel.

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:43.590
These words do not mean that I think 
what you did to Sirius was right.

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:49.350
But the people of Riel were 
saved by your actions.

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.680
Thank you.

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:00.360
I got to say it.

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:05.240
I got to say it.

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:12.050
I got to say it...

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:16.550
It took so long. So long...

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:21.180
To say it, I... I...

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:22.890
Me, too.

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:25.310
Thanks for saving my sister.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.820
There are different sides to everything.

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.240
Change your perspective with love, and...

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:42.760
Behold, the universe is 
filled with blessings.

00:17:44.150 --> 00:17:47.370
Dragon, I've proved it.

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:52.320
You came here to say that?

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:57.140
But it's over. Everything is over.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.930
My power is at its limit.

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:02.890
Farewell.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.470
I'll wait for you in the underworld.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:08.920
Takashi...

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:15.910
You worked so hard. Good job.

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:18.110
Come with us.

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.500
There are people waiting for you.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:37.840
It was a wonderful dream, Mom... Dad...

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:50.810
Dragon...

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:54.120
"We just need to keep 
struggling," Sensei says!

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:55.070
I know!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.080
It's no good.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:09.440
I'm sorry, Nozo-san.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.590
Good job.

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:12.790
I'll show you the way out.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:15.960
Where the hell were you?

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:17.590
Getting things ready for you.

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:20.110
First, on the right. A boost item.

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:30.280
It's not far. Endure.

00:19:30.280 --> 00:19:31.190
What's there?

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.300
The entrance to a warp gate

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:37.280
that a certain space fleet once 
used for an interstellar invasion.

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:55.430
Sirius...

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:59.070
It wasn't a miracle that 
caused this gate's distortion

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:02.190
to manifest in subspace at just this time.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:03.590
It was karma.

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:04.820
Karma?

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:10.380
Species that have gone beyond the need 
for bodies can see those things clearly.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:13.440
That's why we chose you.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:15.210
Thank you.

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:16.160
Because of your actions,

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:20.110
we were able to bring Azrabarakura 
back into our community.

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.450
Did I... do the right thing?

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:30.180
Feel free to view this story 
from whatever angle you desire.

00:20:31.300 --> 00:20:34.900
Farewell. Perhaps karma will 
bring us together again.

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:52.140
<b>Planet Sirius</b>

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.850
Do you think we can communicate from here?

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.820
So I'm home, huh?

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:06.120
We made it out of subspace only 
to crash on a dead planet.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:09.560
I'm home, everyone.

00:21:48.150 --> 00:21:49.220
A flower?

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:52.950
It's a flower.

00:21:57.030 --> 00:21:58.130
It's alive.

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:06.740
This planet is still alive.

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:10.600
Yeah, Soya-kun.

00:22:27.340 --> 00:22:28.590
There they are!

00:22:28.590 --> 00:22:30.600
Soya-kun and the others are right there!

00:22:30.600 --> 00:22:33.830
Damn you, Rashaverak!

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:36.460
You returned alive from subspace?!

00:22:36.460 --> 00:22:38.210
That's impossible!

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:40.130
His tail's going crazy.

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:41.790
He's really happy.

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:43.680
Well done, my friend.

00:22:43.680 --> 00:22:46.300
It will take more than subspace to stop you.

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:48.250
Benika, look!

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:49.550
There they are!

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:51.890
Calm down. I can see them.

00:22:52.520 --> 00:22:57.020
They arrived when Takamagahara-kun's 
powers said they would.

00:22:57.320 --> 00:23:01.990
Time in subspace flows 
differently than in our time.

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:05.030
Even Nebula can't calculate it effectively.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:07.770
but amazingly enough, she did it anyway.

00:23:07.770 --> 00:23:10.430
I've never heard of a telepath 
who could do remote detection

00:23:10.430 --> 00:23:12.450
through such a broad span of time and space.

00:23:14.590 --> 00:23:16.170
